 "preferred_name": "Heat bending of wood",
 "kind": "skill",
 "definition": "Shaping wood into curves by softening it with heat or steam and bending it around a form.",
 "description": {
  "text": "The procedure of bending wood into curves and shapes using moisture and a bending iron. The moisture and heat reorganize the wood fibers so the wood does not spring back; it is used in woodworking and for making the sides of stringed musical instruments.",
